WEBVTT

12:02.081 --> 12:04.583
wildlings and white walkers
and whatnot.

12:06.836 --> 12:10.840
We're grateful to have good, strong men
like you protecting us.

12:13.467 --> 12:16.053
We've guarded the Kingdoms
for 8,000 years.

12:19.140 --> 12:21.309
Is it "we" already?

12:22.935 --> 12:24.270
Have you taken your vows, then?

12:24.395 --> 12:25.771
Soon enough.

12:28.232 --> 12:30.443
Give my regards to the Night's Watch.
